O repair that keeps the pieces inside the preimages of a FIXED PAIR of points of P1 can work. The joint-cover variant is refuted (leaf ...joint-cover, rejected) — do not retry it.\n\nWHY R2 AND NOT A FIELD-SIZE HYPOTHESIS: archon-protected.yaml freezes the arbitrary-field statement, so |P1(k)| >= n+2 would answer a different question. R2 is the only field-uniform fix. The sharpness result (leaf ...field-size, done) stands and needs no further human input.\n\nFull reasoning: I-0346 (human comment, 2026-07-28). Executing task: ajcr-cert-r2.",
